<description>&lt;p&gt;Iraqi security forces continued to intercept and destroy explosive-laden drones in Kirkuk, while a militia leader publicly criticized Iraq’s stance on the Iran blockade. Iraqi officials met with Trump to discuss regional security and reaffirmed that Iraq will not be used to attack neighboring countries. A security guard was killed and three people injured in a shooting at an oilfield near Kirkuk. NATO held a high-level political dialogue with Iraqi officials. The UCDP recorded 396 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMirAFBVV95cUxPMVRCbDlmZXRUY0dpZHNFRHl6VWstYjgxWXdSZHltQlhYdURQZTMtQ01pWndRenI0eXVMQmFpdzRSQmFUaG01blRkaHhPT2x0LXRVc3RvSkZXQ3V1OHNVakZmanV1OWZyX3l2LXRqcklHMUEtRXV0MndYNFdsWlp4dUlIaEJZd1l6UVdBN1hYdG9wR0Z5RkdYS0RHM01tamZBbksxM3JzWW1SSWY4?oc=5&quot;&gt;UA.NEWS&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiXEFVX3lxTFB6TDNmeGo2aEN2YVVBUHVyUEVWN3BiVGlablBLelVwdXFuUmoyMHA1YmdkSHp3ejF3ekVoTE16b3lOd08wNC1qY1ducmJrOUowTGFFZHZlbHBxMEVj?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Jerusalem Post&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMifkFVX3lxTE5CZVcxMzJhaHVwbGpOMkpBam5tdEZ0SWRmT3NOSGRYUUhsQkEtWll1b2tpNThUNFRhMzNXR19WcjRPMkhDQzFmYjMxSnlxM19jcnFJVGwxTTdqUGJ4c2JPdjMzQnIyQ0xHeXJ1TExjQnZjYkRIN0FadHdtME1ZQQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;U.S. Embassy &amp;amp; Consulate in Iraq (.gov)&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMitgFBVV95cUxNQ0F0Rnh4cE5HVTAtVWhlbGs0c2VzaVI5NlN4OEQyZjBlTTBaQ2dWWWlIdkl6NlVCU3NsWWsxLThkMlEwcFFzcDNsc25MY0c5RTVPRktFZ1pFTXlXWFY2MUNhZl9LYndlcEFlMU9ObmxqeEFXRWhVRlRva0NzNlRZWTJxcTRabW9OSFdlLWQ2NHBhdkV6TzBwQkE2TzlPaGJ0c2NyWVc4MDRyY2wwMnA4TmlOZTJKdw?oc=5&quot;&gt;MEMRI | Middle East Media Research Institute&lt;/a&gt;,